flowchart TD
    subgraph KB[LEGAL KNOWLEDGE BASE]
        MD[Curated Markdown under backend/data/legal_knowledge]
        KCH[1200-char chunks with 150-char overlap]
        KEM[Cohere search_document embeddings]
        KQ[(Qdrant legal_knowledge)]
        MD --> KCH --> KEM --> KQ
    end

    U[User PDF or TXT upload] --> TMP[Temporary upload file]
    TMP --> PARSE[Docling parser; pdfplumber fallback]
    PARSE --> SEG[ClauseNode structure-aware segmentation]
    SEG --> VAL[Ollama real-clause validator]
    VAL --> QEM[Cohere search_query embeddings]
    QEM --> CQ[(Qdrant cuad_train)]
    CQ --> RET[Dense Top-5 CUAD retrieval]
    RET --> CAND[Unique retrieved candidate labels]
    CAND --> CLS[Candidate-constrained Ollama CUAD classification]
    CLS --> STATUS[Classification status check]
    STATUS -->|VALID_CANDIDATE| MAP[Map CUAD label to legal category]
    STATUS -->|UNKNOWN / MALFORMED / OUT_OF_CANDIDATE| SKIP[Typed risk SKIPPED]
    MAP --> LRET[Category-filtered legal Top-3 retrieval]
    KQ --> LRET
    LRET --> IND[Regex indicators and contract evidence]
    IND --> RISK[Constrained Ollama risk assessment]
    RISK --> STRICT[Strict validation]
    STRICT --> OUT[Typed ClauseResult]
    SKIP --> OUT
    OUT --> API[FastAPI JSON or SSE]
    API --> UI[React frontend]

    subgraph BUILD[CUAD INDEX BUILD]
        RAW[CUAD v1 raw wide CSV] --> SPLIT[Contract-level train/test split]
        SPLIT --> LONG[Long clause rows; metadata flagged]
        LONG --> EMB[Train substantive clause embeddings]
        EMB --> CQ
    end

